WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.667
Hello.
How are you?

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.959
I'm here, directly from São Paulo,

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:12.750
to communicate a great new feature
from the world of Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.000
My name is Ricardo,

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:16.834
and I help companies in Brazil
to migrate to Google Cloud.

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:19.625
Our team works on cases
such as SulAmérica,

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:23.208
which uses solutions such as App Engine,
CloudSQL and Datastore

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:26.417
to create innovative applications
and a highly scalable

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.250
hybrid environment and performance.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:30.917
Another interesting case
is that of Contabilizei,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.250
a start-up
that provides accounting services

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.417
for small and medium companies
across the country

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.667
and runs all of its highly scalable
infrastructure within the GCP,

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.166
using services such as
the Google Container Engine and BigQuery.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.000
The new region of São Paulo will enable

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:48.125
clients to process and store
their data in Brazil.

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:51.083
This means consistent gains
in speed

00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:52.875
for all of our clients in the region.

00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:58.125
Our performance tests demonstrate
a 50% to 95% reduction in latency

00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:00.708
when we serve clients
throughout South America,

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:03.000
compared to any region
of the United States.

00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:06.208
Google Cloud is continuously
making investments

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:09.041
in infrastructure and services
for your business,

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:13.250
whether they are in Argentina, Colombia,
Chile, Peru or Brazil.

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.875
With all of this,
we are more than eager to see

00:01:15.959 --> 00:01:18.583
what our clients
will create and build

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.000
with the arrival of our region.

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.333
Thank you very much.

